From: Raxcoms <mpaulo968@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] steamcompmgr: add Auto HDR

Add a default-off Auto HDR control for SDR games. When it is enabled,
Gamescope drives HDR output, inverse tone maps the eligible base game
layer, and reports an HDR presentation only after rendering an Auto HDR
frame. Keep native HDR, Steam UI, fades, and existing HDR ITM behavior
unchanged.

---
